##  TypeScript API for 3D Camera Animation: Balancing Helpfulness & Verbosity 

Here's a TypeScript API design prioritizing both clarity (helpfulness) and comprehensive feature coverage (verbosity) for controlling 3D camera animations:

**Core Concepts & Structure**

1. **`CameraController` Class:** The central hub, managing animation state and execution.

   ```typescript
   class CameraController {
       constructor(scene: THREE.Scene, camera: THREE.Camera); // Initialize with scene & camera

       // Animation Definition & Playback
       addAnimation(name: string, animation: AnimationDefinition): void;
       playAnimation(name: string, options?: AnimationPlaybackOptions): void;
       stopAnimation(name?: string): void;
       pauseAnimation(name?: string): void;
       resumeAnimation(name?: string): void;

       //  Manipulator Methods (Direct Control)
       setPosition(position: THREE.Vector3): void;
       lookAt(target: THREE.Vector3, up?: THREE.Vector3): void;
       setFOV(fov: number): void;
       animate gradualmenteProperty(property: 'position'|'rotation'|'fov', targetValue: any, duration: number, easing?: EasingFunction): Promise<void>; // Animated transitions

       // Utilities
       getCurrentAnimation(): AnimationPlaybackInfo | null;
       clearAnimations(): void;
   }
   ```

2. **`AnimationDefinition` Interface:** Blueprint for defining animations.

   ```typescript
   interface AnimationDefinition {
       name: string; // Unique identifier
       duration: number; // in seconds
       keyframes: Keyframe[]; // Array of pose snapshots
       loop: boolean; // Repeat behavior
       easing: EasingFunction; // Optional easing curve
   }

   interface Keyframe {
       time: number; // Relative time (0-1) within animation
       position: THREE.Vector3;
       rotation: THREE.Euler; // Or Quaternion for finer control
       fov: number; // Optional FOV change
       otherProperties: { [key: string]: any }; //  Extras (e.g., scale, camera effects)
   }
   ```

3. **`AnimationPlaybackOptions` Interface (for playback control):**

   ```typescript
